// Library.SQLLex.ailang — SQL lexer. Identifiers are folded to lowercase.
// Keywords are token codes at 100 and above. Operators are 1..25.
// Copyright (c) 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

LibraryImport.SQLiteSQL.SQLState

